+}
+/*
+ * THE PUCK BRIDGE MENU (owner's design C4, the list): the rows the Mac sent in `pb.menu`, four at a time in the
+ * controls list's geometry (TAB_TOP, TAB_ROW_HEIGHT; a drag moves it a row at a time, tabs_move), each its label in
